    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban individuals from camping outside of retail stores before special events",
        "additional_details": "We feel like this behaviour means others are at a huge disadvantage. Less fortunate households sometimes simply cannot camp outside for special events.",
        "background": "I would like individuals to be banned from camping outside retail stores. This includes camping within store car parks for hours before normal opening times. This could discourage scalpers and huge profit making on reselling platforms.",
